id: recolored-saibaman
name: Recolored Saibaman
order: 1
category: body
# "[Surprise Tactics]": it replaces that Secondary Racial Trait.
importance: secondary
race: saibaman
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  Instead of the typical green of a Saibaman, you sport a fancy new palette swap.
text: >
  Recolored Saibaman (Body) [Surprise Tactics]: Instead of the typical green of a Saibaman, you sport a fancy new palette swap.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Racial Life Modifier by 1 while you are below the Injured Health Threshold (this does not retroactively increase your Life Points).
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of your Signature Techniques by x(T), where x is equal to 1/2 of your Racial Life Modifier (min. 1).
  (3)-[Option]: Upon gaining this Factor Trait, select and gain access to one of the following effects:

  * Red Pepperman [Passive]: While your Racial Life Modifier is 3+, increase your Wound Rolls and Might by 2(T) and 1(T) respectively.
  * Blue Kawaireman [Passive]: While your Racial Life Modifier is 3+, increase your Defense Value by 1(T).
  * Yellow Kyukonman [Passive]: While your Racial Life Modifier is 3+, increase your Soak Value by 2(T).
  * Pink Tennenman [Passive]: While your Racial Life Modifier is 3+, increase the Combat Rolls of your adjacent Allies by 1(T). This effect does not stack if multiple Characters with this effect are adjacent to you.
  * White Jinkouman [Passive]: While your Racial Life Modifier is 3+, increase your Awareness by 1(T).
  * Gold Kinkanman [Triggered/Defeated]: Select an Ally. They may use a Healing Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. Increase the amount of Life Points they regain by 2x(bT), where x is equal to your Racial Life Modifier.
  * Silver Ginnanman [Triggered/Defeated]: Select an Ally. They may use a Ki Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. Increase the amount of Ki Points they regain by 2x(bT), where x is equal to your Racial Life Modifier.

---

[passive]
# (1) Injured or worse: 1 for what reads the Racial Life Modifier, not for the Maximum Life Points (actor-character.mjs).
if (belowThreshold("injured")) {
    lifeModifier.gained += 1;
}
# (2) Half the Racial Life Modifier, rounded down - 1 at least.
wound.signature += max(floor(racialLifeModifier / 2), 1) * 1(T);

# (3) Its Option, chosen as it is added - each a file beside it.
